{"id":"n57311-1-11","stage":2,"title":"자기 · 自己","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57311-1-11-1","ko":"철수는 다른 사람 생각은 별로 안 하는 것 같아.","zh":"看来哲洙不太会为别人着想啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"철수는","meaning":"哲洙","explanation":"철수：哲洙；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"철수는","audio":"/audio/718c461235834340c2b7.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"철수는","audio":"/audio/718c461235834340c2b7.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的。","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}},{"text":"생각은","meaning":"着想，考虑","explanation":"생각：着想，考虑；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"7","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각은","audio":"/audio/e50a186c9a1f2502e9a2.mp3"}},{"text":"별로","meaning":"（不）怎么，（不）太","explanation":"별로 在本句与后面的 안、없다、-지 않다 等否定表达合用，合起来表示“不怎么、不太”。否定意义需要和后文一起理解。","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"